x transparent;}      a.rss,  a.facebook,  a.twitter {   padding:0 17px 5px;   margin:0 5px;  }  a.rss {background: url("http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons.png") no-repeat scroll -62px 0px transparent;}  a.facebook {background: url("http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons.png") no-repeat scroll -101px 0px transparent;}  a.twitter {background: url("http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons.png") no-repeat scroll -142px 0px transparent;}  </style>    </head>    <body>           <div class="row mainNav">      <img src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/purchase-confirmation-top-gradient-white-logo.png" alt="Webroot" />  </div>    <div class="row">      <div class="large-12 columns">       <h1>Your Product Receipt and Next Steps</h1>      </div>  </div>  <div class="row">      <div class="large-12 columns">                  <table id="soldByBillinginfo" class="responsive">              <tbody>               <tr>                   <td><h3>SOLD BY</h3></td>                      <td><h3>BILLING INFORMATION</h3></td>                  </tr>                  <tr>                   <td>Webroot Inc.</td>                      <td>Stanley Roschelle</td>                  </tr>                                                                                                <tr>                   <td>Dec 12 2013, 13:45</td>                      <td>4043 65 PL E </td>                  </tr>                  <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>Sarasota, FL 34243</td>                  </tr>                  <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>United States</td>                  </tr>                                  <tr>                   <td><strong>Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:stanleyroschelle@gmail.com">stanleyroschelle@gmail.com</a></td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                  </tr>                                <tr>                   <td><strong>Invoice #</strong>: ECM0038575143</td>                      <td>Paid with American Express ending 2008</td>                  </tr>              </tbody>          </table>                       </div>  </div>    <div class="row">      <div class="large-12 columns">       <table id="emailReceipt" class="responsive">           <thead>               <tr>                      <td colspan="4">ORDER SUMMARY</td>                  </tr>              </thead>              <tbody>               <tr>                   <td>QTY</td>                      <td>ITEM</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>PRICE</td>                  </tr>                                <tr>                   <td>1</td>                                         <td>Webroot SecureAnywhere Antivirus 1 Device 1 Year Subscription<br/>                                     <br/>                 Product Key: SSFCONLNAADINXKCYZWK                      </td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                  <td>USD                                                                                            <span class="retail-price" data-format-price>                   $29.99                 </span>                                       </td>                  </tr>                              <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>Tax:</td>                      <td>USD                             $1.95                     </td>                  </tr>                        <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>Total:</td>                      <td>USD                          $31.94                    </td>                                         </tr>              </tbody>          </table>      </div>  </div>      <div class="row">     <div class="large-12 columns">      <div class="emailMessage">             <p>Dear Valued Customer,</p>             <p>Thank you for choosing Webroot! Below are your download and installation instructions for  Webroot SecureAnywhere Antivirus 1 Device 1 Year Subscription .</p>         </div>         <h2>You''re Not Done Yet! Next Steps:</h2>         <h3>New to Webroot?</h3>         <ol>          <li>Ensure that your computer is connected to the Internet.</li>             <li><p>Click the Download Button</p>             <p><a href="http://www.webroot.com/prodCheck/?oc=dl&amp;kc=SSFCONLN4DC50F81FC50"><img src=''https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-download-buttons-pc.png'' /></a>  <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/macinstaller"><img src=''https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-download-buttons-mac.png'' /></a></p></li>             <li><p>When prompted, enter your keycode.</p>             <p><strong>Your keycode is</strong>:  SSFCONLN4DC50F81FC50 </p>             <p>If you experience issues entering your keycode, try copying and pasting it directly into the keycode field in the installation window.</p></li>         </ol>         <h3>Already have Webroot SecureAnywhere installed?</h3>         <ol>          <li>Ensure that your computer is connected to the Internet.</li>             <li>Open Webroot SecureAnywhere.</li>             <li>Click the gear icon next to <strong>My Account</strong>.</li>             <li><p>Enter the keycode you want to activate in the Activate a New Keycode field and click Activate.</p>             <p><strong>Your keycode is</strong>:  SSFCONLN4DC50F81FC50 </p>             <p>If you experience issues entering your keycode, try copying and pasting it directly into the keycode field in the installation window.</p></li>         </ol>         <h3>Have an older version of Webroot (<img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-purple.png" />&nbsp;or <img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-yellow.png" />) installed?</h3>   <ol>          <li>Uninstall the older Webroot version via the Control panel. For detailed instructions, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/uninstallinstructions" target="_blank">click here</a>.</li>             <li>Follow the instructions in the <strong>New to Webroot</strong> section above.</li>         </ol><br/><br/>         <h3>Need more detailed instructions or help installing Webroot on a mobile device?</h3>         <p class="installationHelp"><a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/mobileinstructions" target="_blank">Click here for detailed, step-by-step installation help.</a></p>         <h3>Technical Support Issues</h3>         <p>If you require assistance from Technical Support, open this link on the computer experiencing the issue: <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/supportticket" target="_blank">Send feedback or ask a question</a></p>         <h3>Licensing</h3>         <p>Your keycode uniquely identifies your subscription. Your software license is valid for [ 1 device ]. If you want to install on more devices than the number allowed for your subscription, you must purchase additional licenses to match the number of devices the program is to be installed on. For more details, please read the full license agreement included with the installation program displayed during setup.</p>         <h3>Uninterrupted Protection - Automatic Renewal Service</h3>         <p>Webroot Inc. will conveniently protect your devices from ongoing security threats by, upon the expiration of each subscription term, automatically renewing your subscription at the then-current applicable subscription price (plus applicable taxes), excluding any promotional or discount pricing available at the time of the renewal. At the end of your initial subscription term, Webroot will automatically renew your subscription for an additional year. Thereafter, your subscription will renew annually. When you purchased your initial subscription, you authorized Webroot to use the contact and billing information you provided to automatically renew your subscription. You will receive email notification prior to renewal. You may discontinue this service at any time. For more information, or to opt-out of the automatic renewal service, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/customerSupport/auto_renewal_optout.php?kc=SSFCONLN4DC50F81FC50" target="_blank">click here</a>.</p>         <h3>Join the Community</h3>         <p>Webroot has created the best collection of shared knowledge on internet security. Join us through one of these social networks, or on the <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/products/community">Webroot Community forum</a>.</p>         <p> <a href="https://blog.webroot.com/feed/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-rss.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.facebook.com/webroot/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-facebook.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href="https://twitter.com/Webroot"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-twitter.png" /></a></p>         <p>Thanks again. Please feel free to contact us if there''s anything else we can do to support your ongoing need for enhanced privacy, performance and peace of mind.</p>       <p><strong>The Webroot Team</strong><br/>   Webroot, Inc.<br/>   <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/">http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/</a></p>                      </div> </div>   </body>  </html>  ');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[email_message_html] ([email_message_html_id], [email_message_id], [customer_email], [email_message_body]) VALUES (11,11,'kimatkips@aol.com','Dear Valued Customer, <br><br> Success!  Your Webroot SecureAnywhere Endpoint Protection Keycode is ready for Registration! <br> Thank you for submitting your contact information. You can begin using Endpoint Protection by simply applying the keycode provided below to your personal Webroot Portal. You are just minutes away from joining the thousands of IT pros around the world who trust Webroot solutions to manage/secure their IT infrastructures. <br><br> - Your Endpoint will download and install in less than four seconds. <br><br> So let''s get started: <br><br> Step 1:   Use this link to set up your own account using your licensed keycode https://detail.webrootanywhere.com/p4Inbound.asp?CMD=P40QIKREG&LIC=SAE5ENTPF6BC744AA2A9&email=kimatkips@aol.com<br><br>  *   If you already have an account, just add your new keycode to your existing account<br>  *   Login to Webroot SecureAnywhere (https://my.webrootanywhere.com/) with your existing account.<br>  *   Click "Manage Keycodes" from the user drop-down menu at the top right.<br>  *   Click the "Add Product Keycode" button.<br>  * Enter your keycode into the box and press "Add".  Your keycode has now been successfully added to your existing console. <br> Step 2:  Your keycode is SAE5ENTPF6BC744AA2A9<br><br> Step 3:  Confirm your account by using the link in the confirmation email you''ll receive<br><br> Step 4:  Log in to your new account and follow the wizard to set up your security environment<br><br> <br><br> It is that easy.  <br><br> Notes: The setup wizard will present you with several options to download and deploy the Webroot SecureAnywhere agent software to your company endpoints. We strongly recommend that you follow the setup wizard and read the Endpoint Protection Guide before starting deployment. Once an agent has been deployed on an endpoint, it reports immediately into the console.  <br><br> Product Guides <br> ------------------------ <br><br> Webroot SecureAnywhere - Endpoint Protection Guide (http://download.webroot.com/WSA_Endpoint_Protection_Guide.pdf)  <br><br> Technical Support Issues <br> ------------------------ <br><br> Click the Help or Support option next to your login ID in the SecureAnywhere Website, or within the status screen of the agent software. If this is not possible, please follow this link http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/support-business <br><br> Existing Webroot Customers <br> ------------------------ <br><br> Need assistance migrating your existing Webroot Endpoint product to Webroot SecureAnywhere - Endpoint Protection? Get help with installation http://www.webroot.com/us/en/business/products/business-migration or contact our Professional Services team for additional installation options:<br> North America: 1-800-870-8102<br> Australia: +61 2 8071 1900<br> Europe, Middle East, & Africa: +44 (0) 870 141 7070 <br> <br><br> The Webroot Team <br> Webroot, Inc.<br> <br>');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[email_message_html] ([email_message_html_id], [email_message_id], [customer_email], [email_message_body]) VALUES (12,12,'kimatkips@aol.com','<html>   <head>    <meta charset="UTF-8" />   </head>   <body style="padding:0;margin:0;width:650px;">    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="650" style="padding:0;">     <tr>      <td style="font-family:Open Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif">                         <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-top: 2px solid #97c036; padding-top: 24px;font-family:Open Sans,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">   <tr>    <td valign="top">     <img src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/webroot-logo-large.png" alt="Webroot" height="24" width="224" style="display:block;margin-bottom:24px;" />     <h1 style="font-weight:200;margin-bottom:36px;">Thank you for your purchase!</h1>     <p>In order to keep all your digital gear safe and secure, follow the      You''re Not Done Yet - Product Next Steps in the      Additional Purchase Information section below.</p>       <p>We''ve also sent you a copy of this receipt for your records.</p>    </td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td valign="top">     <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="font-family:Open Sans,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">          <tr>                <th align="left">Billing Address</th>               </tr>      <tr>            <td valign="top">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="font-size:12px;font-family:Open Sans,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">         <tr>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">First Name</td>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Dennis P</td>         </tr>         <tr>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Last Name</td>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Mailly</td>         </tr>         <tr>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Company Name</td>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;"></td>         </tr>         <tr>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Email Address</td>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">kimatkips@aol.com</td>         </tr>                <tr>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">Address</td>          <td valign="top" style="padding-top:12px;padding-left:12px;">           1573 Vandagriff <br />           corona, CA 92883<br />          </td>         </tr>               </table>             </td>           </tr>     </table>    </td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td valign="top" style="padding-top:36px;">     <h3>Order Summary</h3>     <p>      <strong>Invoice #: ENT0038575151</strong>     </p>     <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-top: 2px solid #97c036;font-size:12px;font-family:Open Sans,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">      <thead>       <tr>        <th align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8">Qty.</th>        <th align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8">Product Description</th>        <th align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8">Price</th>       </tr>      </thead>      <tbody>                <tr>       <td style="padding:6px;" valign="top">        12     </td>       <td style="padding:6px;" valign="top">        Webroot SecureAnywhere Endpoint Protection            <p><span class="kc">SAE5ENTPF6BC744AA2A9</span></p>             </td>       <td style="padding:6px;" valign="top">                               <span class="retail-price" data-format-price>         $662.40      </span>            </td>      </tr>            <tr>       <td colspan="2" align="right" style="background-color:#e8e8e8;text-transform:capitalize;font-weight:bold;padding:6px;">Sub Total:</td>       <td align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8;">$662.40</td>      </tr>      <tr>       <td colspan="2" align="right" style="background-color:#e8e8e8;text-transform:capitalize;font-weight:bold;padding:6px;">Tax:</td>       <td align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8;">$53.04</td>      </tr>         <tr>       <td colspan="2" align="right" style="background-color:#e8e8e8;text-transform:capitalize;font-weight:bold;padding:6px;">Total:</td>       <td align="left" style="padding:6px;background-color:#e8e8e8;">$715.44</td>      </tr>      </tbody>     </table>    </td>   </tr>   <tr>    <td style="padding-top:36px">         <p>  Thank you for selecting Webroot SecureAnywhere Endpoint Protection. Follow the steps below to get started. </p> <ul>  <li>Create your account using your license keycode    <a href="https://detail.webrootanywhere.com/p4Inbound.asp?CMD=P40QIKREG&amp;LIC=SAE5ENTPF6BC744AA2A9&amp;email=kimatkips@aol.com">here</a>.   Your keycode is: SAE5ENTPF6BC744AA2A9 </li>  <li>Confirm your account by clicking the link in the confirmation email</li>    <li>Log in to your account and follow the step-by-step instructions in the setup wizard to setup your endpoint security environment</li>  </ul> <p>It''s that easy</p> <p>  <strong>Note: </strong>   The setup wizard will present you with several options to download and deploy the   Webroot SecureAnywhere agent software to your company endpoints. We strongly   recommend that you follow the setup wizard and read the Deployment and/or User Guide   before starting deployment. Once an agent has been deployed on an endpoint, it reports   immediately into the console. </p>     <h4>Product Guide</h4>   <p>Webroot SecureAnywhere Endpoint Protection <a href="http://download.webroot.com/WSA_Endpoint_Protection_Guide.pdf">Guide</a></p>    <h4>Existing Webroot Customers</h4>   <p>Need assistance migrating your existing Webroot endpoint product to    Webroot SecureAnywhere Endpoint Protection?    Get help with installation or contact our Professional Services team for additional installation options at    1-866-612-4268.</p>      <h4>Important Account Information</h4>  <p>Should you need support, need to reinstall the software or have questions about your billing, you will need the following account information.</p>  <dl>   <dt>Email Address: </dt><dd>kimatkips@aol.com (for support)</dd>   <dt>Invoice: </dt><dd>ENT0038575151</dd>  </dl>              <h3>Sales Tax Information</h3>     <p>We currently charge sales tax in jurisdictions where we are legally required to do so based on applicable state and local tax laws and rates. Sales tax collected from customers is then remitted to the appropriate taxing jurisdiction.</p><p>Many state and local tax jurisdictions have changed their laws in this regard. As laws change, we update the amount of sales tax charged and believe we are in compliance with all current tax laws</p>  </td>   </tr>  </table>            </td>     </tr>    </table>   </body>  </html>  ');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[email_message_html] ([email_message_html_id], [email_message_id], [customer_email], [email_message_body]) VALUES (13,13,'martin.hodgkiss@outlook.com','Dear Valued Customer, <br><br> Thank you for choosing Webroot Software!  Below are your download and installation instructions for Webroot SecureAnywhere Internet Security Plus. <br><br> You must use this keycode during installation and all future installations: SAFEONLN39559D68F5C4<br><br> To install the Webroot SecureAnywhere Internet Security Plus software on a PC: <br><br>  1. You must have an internet connection to begin your installation. <br> 2. Click the link to start the download. Download Now http://www.webroot.com/prodCheck/?oc=dl&kc=SAFEONLN39559D68F5C4<br> 3. When prompted, choose a location to save the file and click Save. <br> 4. Locate the file you saved on the desktop or in the location you specified and double-click the file to start the installation. <br> 5. When prompted, enter your keycode: SAFEONLN39559D68F5C4<br> 6. Follow the prompts as they appear. <br><br> To install Webroot SecureAnywhere on a Mac:  <br><br> 1.  Download the SecureAnywhere installer to your Mac from http://anywhere.webrootcloudav.com/zerol/wsamac.dmg <br> 2.  Double-click wsamac.dmg to open the installer. <br> 3.  Drag the Webroot SecureAnywhere icon into the Applications folder. <br> 4.  Open the Applications folder by double-clicking the folder icon. <br> 5.  In the Applications folder, double-click the Webroot SecureAnywhere icon to begin activation. <br> 6.  In the first activation window, enter your keycode and click Activate. <br> 7.  If prompted, confirm the installation by entering your Apple system password and click OK. <br><br> Technical Support Issues <br> Please click on the Help and Support link within the status screen of the software. If this is not possible, please follow the link below via the computer experiencing the issue: Send Feedback https://www.webrootanywhere.com/servicewelcome.asp? <br><br> Installation Tips <br> If you have trouble clicking on the download link, cut and paste or type the web site address directly into your browser address bar. The web site address is case sensitive; make sure you use lower-case letters or the link will not work. <br><br>  When entering your keycode during installation, you can use copy and paste by using your mouse to highlight the full key code and selecting Copy from the Edit menu. When prompted for the keycode, place your cursor in the first keycode entry box and click Paste from the Edit menu. <br><br>  Your Key Code <br> Your key code uniquely identifies your product installation, protecting your software and enabling you to access future product updates more conveniently. We do not use it for any other purpose than to register your product with us. <br><br>  Usage License <br> You have purchased one or more licensed copies of Webroot SecureAnywhere. For each copy purchased, you have the right to use and install that copy on one device. If you intend to install on more devices than the number of licenses purchased, you must purchase additional licenses to match the number of devices the software is to be installed on. For more details, please read the full license agreement included with the installation program displayed during setup. <br><br>  Information Regarding Your Mobile Purchase <br><br>  Download instructions for Android Smartphones and Tablets: <br> * Make sure you have created your account on the Webroot SecureAnywhere Online Portal : https://my.webrootanywhere.com/registration.asp .<br> * Download Webroot SecureAnywhere Mobile from http://android.webroot.com. This will lead you to the Android Marketplace/Google Play Store. Please ensure that you are signed into the Android Market/Google Play Store with your google account before downloading our app.<br> * On the Permissions screen, press "Accept & download".<br> * After the app is installed, press the "Open" button to go to Webroot SecureAnywhere Mobile.<br> * While on the License Agreement screen, press "Accept".<br> * Login to Webroot SecureAnywhere Mobile with your existing Webroot SecureAnywhere account by pressing the link "I already have a Webroot account". If you do not already have an existing Webroot account, please create one.<br> * While on the home screen of the app, hit the menu button on your Smartphone or Tablet. <br> * Next tap Register.<br> * Tap Activate.<br> * Enter your new Webroot SecureAnywhere Mobile Premier keycode and press OK.<br><br>  Download instructions for Webroot SecureWeb for Android<br> * Download the Webroot SecureWeb app from https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.webroot.secureweb <br> * After the app is downloaded and installed on your device, the password management functions can be accessed by clicking the key icon: <br>   * Enter your SecureAnywhere username and password. This is the same login that you use to access your account on the Webroot SecureAnywhere Online Portal https://my.webrootanywhere.com/  <br>  Download instructions for iPad®, iPhone® or iPod® Touch:<br> * Download and install the SecureWeb app from iTunes® at http://itunes.apple.com/us/app/webroot-secureweb-browser/id460986853?mt=8 . <br> * Enter your Apple ID password.<br> * The SecureWeb app will download and install on your device.<br>   Thanks again. Please feel free to contact us if there''s anything else we can do to support your ongoing need for enhanced privacy, performance and peace of mind.<br><br> The Webroot Team<br> Webroot Inc.<br>  http://www.webroot.co.uk/En_GB/support.html ');
