M0038575160</td>                      <td>Paid with American Express ending 2027</td>                  </tr>              </tbody>          </table>                       </div>  </div>    <div class="row">      <div class="large-12 columns">       <table id="emailReceipt" class="responsive">           <thead>               <tr>                      <td colspan="4">ORDER SUMMARY</td>                  </tr>              </thead>              <tbody>               <tr>                   <td>QTY</td>                      <td>ITEM</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>PRICE</td>                  </tr>                                <tr>                   <td>1</td>                                         <td>Webroot SecureAnywhere Antivirus 1 Device 1 Year Subscription<br/>                                     <br/>                 Product Key: SSFDGSTBAADGRSBMSAQM                      </td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                  <td>USD                                                                                            <span class="retail-price" data-format-price>                   $29.99                 </span>                                       </td>                  </tr>                              <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>Tax:</td>                      <td>USD                             $1.80                     </td>                  </tr>                        <tr>                   <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>&nbsp;</td>                      <td>Total:</td>                      <td>USD                          $31.79                    </td>                                         </tr>              </tbody>          </table>      </div>  </div>      <div class="row">     <div class="large-12 columns">      <div class="emailMessage">             <p>Dear Valued Customer,</p>             <p>Thank you for choosing Webroot! Below are your download and installation instructions for  Webroot SecureAnywhere Antivirus 1 Device 1 Year Subscription .</p>         </div>         <h2>You''re Not Done Yet! Next Steps:</h2>         <h3>New to Webroot?</h3>         <ol>          <li>Ensure that your computer is connected to the Internet.</li>             <li><p>Click the Download Button</p>             <p><a href="http://www.webroot.com/prodCheck/?oc=dl&amp;kc=SSFDGSTB3174DB514183"><img src=''https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-download-buttons-pc.png'' /></a>  <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/macinstaller"><img src=''https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-download-buttons-mac.png'' /></a></p></li>             <li><p>When prompted, enter your keycode.</p>             <p><strong>Your keycode is</strong>:  SSFDGSTB3174DB514183 </p>             <p>If you experience issues entering your keycode, try copying and pasting it directly into the keycode field in the installation window.</p></li>         </ol>         <h3>Already have Webroot SecureAnywhere installed?</h3>         <ol>          <li>Ensure that your computer is connected to the Internet.</li>             <li>Open Webroot SecureAnywhere.</li>             <li>Click the gear icon next to <strong>My Account</strong>.</li>             <li><p>Enter the keycode you want to activate in the Activate a New Keycode field and click Activate.</p>             <p><strong>Your keycode is</strong>:  SSFDGSTB3174DB514183 </p>             <p>If you experience issues entering your keycode, try copying and pasting it directly into the keycode field in the installation window.</p></li>         </ol>         <h3>Have an older version of Webroot (<img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-purple.png" />&nbsp;or <img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-yellow.png" />) installed?</h3>   <ol>          <li>Uninstall the older Webroot version via the Control panel. For detailed instructions, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/uninstallinstructions" target="_blank">click here</a>.</li>             <li>Follow the instructions in the <strong>New to Webroot</strong> section above.</li>         </ol><br/><br/>         <h3>Need more detailed instructions or help installing Webroot on a mobile device?</h3>         <p class="installationHelp"><a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/mobileinstructions" target="_blank">Click here for detailed, step-by-step installation help.</a></p>         <h3>Technical Support Issues</h3>         <p>If you require assistance from Technical Support, open this link on the computer experiencing the issue: <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/supportticket" target="_blank">Send feedback or ask a question</a></p>         <h3>Licensing</h3>         <p>Your keycode uniquely identifies your subscription. Your software license is valid for [ 1 device ]. If you want to install on more devices than the number allowed for your subscription, you must purchase additional licenses to match the number of devices the program is to be installed on. For more details, please read the full license agreement included with the installation program displayed during setup.</p>         <h3>Uninterrupted Protection - Automatic Renewal Service</h3>         <p>Webroot Inc. will conveniently protect your devices from ongoing security threats by, upon the expiration of each subscription term, automatically renewing your subscription at the then-current applicable subscription price (plus applicable taxes), excluding any promotional or discount pricing available at the time of the renewal. At the end of your initial subscription term, Webroot will automatically renew your subscription for an additional year. Thereafter, your subscription will renew annually. When you purchased your initial subscription, you authorized Webroot to use the contact and billing information you provided to automatically renew your subscription. You will receive email notification prior to renewal. You may discontinue this service at any time. For more information, or to opt-out of the automatic renewal service, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/customerSupport/auto_renewal_optout.php?kc=SSFDGSTB3174DB514183" target="_blank">click here</a>.</p>         <h3>Join the Community</h3>         <p>Webroot has created the best collection of shared knowledge on internet security. Join us through one of these social networks, or on the <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/products/community">Webroot Community forum</a>.</p>         <p> <a href="https://blog.webroot.com/feed/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-rss.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.facebook.com/webroot/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-facebook.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href="https://twitter.com/Webroot"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-twitter.png" /></a></p>         <p>Thanks again. Please feel free to contact us if there''s anything else we can do to support your ongoing need for enhanced privacy, performance and peace of mind.</p>       <p><strong>The Webroot Team</strong><br/>   Webroot, Inc.<br/>   <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/">http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/</a></p>                      </div> </div>   </body>  </html>  ');
