Control panel. For detailed instructions, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/uninstallinstructions" target="_blank">click here</a>.</li>             <li>Follow the instructions in the <strong>New to Webroot</strong> section above.</li>         </ol><br/><br/>         <h3>Need more detailed instructions or help installing Webroot on a mobile device?</h3>         <p class="installationHelp"><a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/mobileinstructions" target="_blank">Click here for detailed, step-by-step installation help.</a></p>         <h3>Technical Support Issues</h3>         <p>If you require assistance from Technical Support, open this link on the computer experiencing the issue: <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/supportticket" target="_blank">Send feedback or ask a question</a></p>         <h3>Licensing</h3>         <p>Your keycode uniquely identifies your subscription. Your software license is valid for [ 1 device ]. If you want to install on more devices than the number allowed for your subscription, you must purchase additional licenses to match the number of devices the program is to be installed on. For more details, please read the full license agreement included with the installation program displayed during setup.</p>         <h3>Uninterrupted Protection - Automatic Renewal Service</h3>         <p>Webroot Inc. will conveniently protect your devices from ongoing security threats by, upon the expiration of each subscription term, automatically renewing your subscription at the then-current applicable subscription price (plus applicable taxes), excluding any promotional or discount pricing available at the time of the renewal. At the end of your initial subscription term, Webroot will automatically renew your subscription for an additional year. Thereafter, your subscription will renew annually. When you purchased your initial subscription, you authorized Webroot to use the contact and billing information you provided to automatically renew your subscription. You will receive email notification prior to renewal. You may discontinue this service at any time. For more information, or to opt-out of the automatic renewal service, <a href="http://www.webroot.com/customerSupport/auto_renewal_optout.php?kc=SSFCSBWT7F864FDC875B" target="_blank">click here</a>.</p>         <h3>Join the Community</h3>         <p>Webroot has created the best collection of shared knowledge on internet security. Join us through one of these social networks, or on the <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/products/community">Webroot Community forum</a>.</p>         <p> <a href="https://blog.webroot.com/feed/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-rss.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.facebook.com/webroot/"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-facebook.png" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href="https://twitter.com/Webroot"><img src="https://www.webroot.com/shared/images/email-receipt-icons-twitter.png" /></a></p>         <p>Thanks again. Please feel free to contact us if there''s anything else we can do to support your ongoing need for enhanced privacy, performance and peace of mind.</p>       <p><strong>The Webroot Team</strong><br/>   Webroot, Inc.<br/>   <a href="http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/">http://www.webroot.com/us/en/support/</a></p>                      </div> </div>   </body>  </html>  ');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[email_message_html_load] ([email_message_id], [customer_email], [email_message_body], [loaded], [insert_date]) VALUES (1,'techbearglass@gmail.com','<head> <title>Retention Device Enforcement - Email Day 7 | Webroot</title> <meta name="description" content=""><meta name="keywords" content=""> <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"> <meta charset="utf-8"> <link rel="shortcut icon" href="http://www.webroot.com/shared/img_structure/favicon.ico"> <link rel="canonical" href="http://www.webroot.com/shared/cms/view.html"> <!--[if lt IE 8]>  <meta name="copyright" content="Copyright 1997 - 2013 Webroot, Inc. All Rights Reserved." /> <![endif]--> <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="http://www.webroot.com/shared/css/design2013.css" /> <link href="http://www.webroot.com/shared/css/embededFonts.css" rel="stylesheet" />  <script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/JavaScript/design2013.js"></script>  <!--[if lt IE 9]>  <script src="http://css3-mediaqueries-js.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/css3-mediaqueries.js"></script>     <script src="//html5shim.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js"></script> <![endif]-->  <style> body {background: url("http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/device-enforcement-email-bkgd.png") repeat-x scroll 0 0 #efeced;} .large-8.columns p,  .large-4.columns p, .large-4.columns p a {   color: #777777;   margin: 0 0 4.25em -1.5em; } .row.email {   border-radius: 8px 8px 8px 8px;   box-shadow: 0 0 5px 1px #999999;   margin: 3em auto;   padding: 15px;   background-color:#FFF; } h1 {margin-bottom: 1em;} p {   font-size:16px;   line-height:22px;   margin-bottom:1.75em;  } .center {text-align: center;} .right {text-align:right;} .button.radius {   background: url("http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/device-enforcement-button-bkgd.png") no-repeat scroll 0 0 #FB5509;   padding: 10px 10px 10px 35px; } </style>  </head> <body>  <div class="row email">     <div class="large-12 columns">     <div class="large-8 columns"><p>You have exceeded the software activation limits for your subscription.</p></div>     <div class="large-4 columns right"><p><a href=""></a></p></div>      <p><img src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/webroot-logo-green.png" alt="Webroot Logo" /></p>      <h1>Important Service Notification</h1>         <p>Dear Webroot Customer:</p>         <p>Unfortunately, there is an issue with the keycode for your current Webroot product. This occurs when the product is installed on more devices than your subscription permits.  For reference, your product keycode is SA68ZBNG66437E54AFB7 and is valid for 3 Devices</p><p><strong>Due to activation limits, you will need to purchase an additional license or add devices to your current license for your subscription to remain active. If you do not take action, your subscription will be deactivated in 7 days.</strong></p>         <p class="center"><a href="https://www.webroot.com/us/en/cart/device_enforcement/?key=DD5E3CBE-F2EF-43B1-9A4E-52FFAC1B7C29"><img src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/device-enforcement-upgrade-subscription-button.png" /></a></p>         <p>Please call our Customer Service Department at <strong>1-866-612-4268</strong> Monday through Friday 7am-7:30pm MT, or Saturdays & Sundays 7am-6pm MT to purchase an additional license or add devices to your license.</p>         <p>If you are not sure why this issue occurred and want to view and manage your installations, <a href="https://my.webrootanywhere.com/default.asp?action=login">click here</a> to access your Management Console.  Once logged in, you can view the different devices using your subscription, and deactivate devices as needed by clicking on PC Security and deactivating the corresponding device.  If SecureAnywhere is still installed on a device when you deactivate it, SecureAnywhere will uninstall itself from the device automatically. </p>         <p>Next to security, integrity is our priority.  Please help us make Webroot a better product for everyone.</p>         <p>We look forward to hearing from you soon.</p>         <p><img src="http://www.webroot.com/shared/images/device-enforcement-webroot-crew.png" alt="Webroot Crew" /></p>     </div> </div> </body> ',1,'2015-05-27T16:07:55.877');
